'' vendor/raylib6/rlgl -- raylib 6.2's OpenGL abstraction layer, rlgl.h, as one import:
''
''     #import "vendor/raylib6/rlgl"
''
'' raylib's immediate-mode layer over OpenGL -- rlPushMatrix, rlTranslatef, rlBegin, rlVertex3f
'' -- unqualified, for drawing raylib's own functions do not cover. The header is rlgl.ti beside
'' this file, translated from rlgl.h by 'tiko c2t'; its OpenGL includes are tiko's GL/gl.bi and
'' GL/glext.bi. In rlgl.h's API its one C2T-TODO is TRACELOG, a variadic logging macro for
'' raylib's own use; the rest are in RLGL_IMPLEMENTATION, the code that builds raylib itself,
'' which a program never defines, and its OpenGL ES branches, which tiko has no headers for.
''
'' It brings vendor/raylib6 with it -- raylib's names, and its library. The link mode is chosen
'' there, on the module that links: '#import "vendor/raylib6" link static' beside this import.
'' raylib's libraries export rlgl's functions.
#module "rlgl"

#import "vendor/raylib6" public

public #include once "rlgl.ti"
